WEBVTT

00:05:29.556 --> 00:05:31.956
In the metaverse,
these brands may also have

00:05:31.996 --> 00:05:34.436
experiential immersive spaces

00:05:34.436 --> 00:05:38.396
that you can visit and engage directly
with whatever they're selling.

00:05:39.156 --> 00:05:43.356
So the metaverse is providing
these new social creative spaces.

00:05:43.356 --> 00:05:44.956
So if you find yourself worrying

00:05:44.996 --> 00:05:47.276
that your child
is playing too much Minecraft

00:05:47.276 --> 00:05:50.116
or Roblox or Fortnite,

00:05:50.116 --> 00:05:53.596
you can remind yourself
that these are not just games.

00:05:54.516 --> 00:05:56.396
They're hanging out with their friends.

00:05:57.116 --> 00:06:01.756
They’re practicing important life skills
like empathy and teamwork.